Licence for the data in this directory
======================================

The road networks (graphs/*.graphml) and the synthetic truck trajectories
(trajectories/*.csv) in this directory are a database derived from
OpenStreetMap and are made available under the Open Data Commons Open
Database License (ODbL) 1.0:

    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Portions of the database are adapted from material licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0). Those
portions remain subject to the attribution terms of that licence:

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The MIT licence in ../LICENSE covers the pipeline code only. It does not
apply to the data in this directory.


Attribution
-----------

Contains information from OpenStreetMap, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors,
which is made available under the ODbL 1.0.
    https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

Contains material adapted from the following datasets, each licensed under
CC BY 4.0:

  Vicmap Transport - Road Line
    (c) State of Victoria, Department of Energy, Environment and Climate Action
    https://discover.data.vic.gov.au/dataset/vicmap-transport-road-line

  NSW Transport Theme - Road Segment
    (c) State of New South Wales (Spatial Services, a business unit of the
