    https://opendata.transport.nsw.gov.au/data/dataset/4253a054-b377-4b5b-83d1-71385bb6ff33

SOURCES.json records the exact download addresses, the build time and the
SHA-256 digest of each downloaded input.


Changes made to the source data
-------------------------------

OSM roads were filtered to operational truck-accessible edges within 2 km of
each study centre. The reference road layers were clipped to the study
windows, re-coded to a common schema and matched to OSM edges to add names,
tunnel and bridge structure, status and travel direction. Posted speeds were
assigned from the speed-zone lines. Uncovered reference tunnel segments were
added as new edges. Every matched or added edge records its source and match
scores in its ref_* attributes.

The trajectories are synthetic. They were generated on these networks by
step03_generate_quantum_trajectories.py and contain no real vehicle,
location or personal data.


